 who will be the heroine in this Rusical that challenges the acting, singing and dancing of the queens. The best will have a new pin to show off in the werkroom, the worst will go home just days away to the final.","duration":63,"scws_id":386605,"season_id":10154,"created_at":"2025-09-29T15:58:36.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:41:56.000000Z","quality":"SD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-29 17:58:36","images":[{"id":292854,"filename":"422ce303-94a1-472a-a86a-adf52de1cf02.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":129001,"created_at":"2025-09-29T15:58:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T15:58:37.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/422ce303-94a1-472a-a86a-adf52de1cf02.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":373363,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":129001,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 7"}]},{"id":129002,"number":8,"name":"Episodio 8","plot":"Un episodio con una mini-sfida molto instabile. Le regine devono truccarsi mentre sono in autobus, che sembra avere un autista con la passione per la velocità. Dopo aver cercato di tenere ferme le mani, dovranno scrivere, recitare e far ridere i giudici in una sfida di recitazione ispirata agli spettacoli della televisione messicana.","duration":63,"scws_id":386606,"season_id":10154,"created_at":"2025-09-29T16:01:52.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:41:56.000000Z","quality":"SD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-29 18:01:52","images":[{"id":292855,"filename":"2f2e186b-8790-4c30-86ae-7f19e490a7f6.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":129002,"created_at":"2025-09-29T16:01:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T16:01:53.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/2f2e186b-8790-4c30-86ae-7f19e490a7f6.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":373364,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":129002,"locale":"it"